          "speaker": "父亲"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:008",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "然后再上去，拍球再跑几步就累死累活。打半个小时就差不多跑不动了。",
          "file": "zh-cn/2026-09-18-too-tired-to-run_dialogue_008_zh-cn.mp3",
